        <note priority="1" from="meaning">Support FAQ</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="5952009488058293477" datatype="html">
        <source>Mantikai is a tarot app for iOS and Android. You ask a question, draw cards from the classic Rider–Waite deck, and AI writes an interpretation of the spread for your question — in English, Russian or Spanish.</source>
        <target>Mantikai es una app de tarot para iOS y Android. Haces una pregunta, sacas cartas de la clásica baraja Rider-Waite y la IA escribe una interpretación de la tirada para tu pregunta, en español, inglés o ruso.</target>
        <context-group purpose="location">
          <context context-type="sourcefile">libs/support/page/src/lib/support-page.ts</context>
          <context context-type="linenumber">26</context>
        </context-group>
        <note priority="1" from="description">Answer to «What is Mantikai?»</note>
        <note priority="1" from="meaning">Support FAQ</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="6861962368859058983" datatype="html">
        <source>How many readings can I do per day?</source>
        <target>¿Cuántas tiradas puedo hacer al día?</target>
        <context-group purpose="location">
          <context context-type="sourcefile">libs/support/page/src/lib/support-page.ts</context>
          <context context-type="linenumber">29</context>
        </context-group>
        <note priority="1" from="description">Question</note>
        <note priority="1" from="meaning">Support FAQ</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="4559581354646187002" datatype="html">
        <source>Every day you get 1 Card of the Day and 3 readings with a question (Three Cards and The Cross share these 3). The limits reset at midnight UTC; the Home screen shows how many are left.</source>
        <target>Cada día tienes 1 Carta del día y 3 tiradas con pregunta (Tres cartas y La cruz comparten esas 3). Los límites se renuevan a medianoche UTC; en Inicio puedes ver cuántas te quedan.</target>
        <context-group purpose="location">
          <context context-type="sourcefile">libs/support/page/src/lib/support-page.ts</context>
          <context context-type="linenumber">30</context>
        </context-group>
        <note priority="1" from="description">Answer about daily limits; Three Cards and The Cross are spread names in the app</note>
        <note priority="1" from="meaning">Support FAQ</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="4190061077092947832" datatype="html">
        <source>How do I change the language or the card back?</source>
        <target>¿Cómo cambio el idioma o el reverso de las cartas?</target>
        <context-group purpose="location">
          <context context-type="sourcefile">libs/support/page/src/lib/support-page.ts</context>
